# The whole world map in dev mode (owner, 2026-09-18, "in dev mode you should
# obviously be able to reveal the full world map on the map").
#
# The proof is the PAIR of frames, not either one: the same survey, the same seed,
# the same scale, first as the player has walked it and then whole. A single
# revealed map proves nothing — a map is supposed to show the world — and the
# thing that could go wrong here is silent in one picture and obvious in two.
#
# Frame 3 is the other half and it is the one that matters: the fog comes back
# exactly. A cheat that cannot be turned off is a cheat that ends up in somebody's
# save, and this one is deliberately built so it cannot.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/dev-map.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --dev=go
coast calm
wait 1.0

# `--dev=go` stands the app up at boot, and a page on the glass holds every other
# key, so the first thing to do is put it away.
tap dev_toggle
await app:none 5

# --- as walked: a disc around the spawn and nothing else -------------------------------
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.4
shot 01-as-walked with app:map
press map 0.2
await app:none 5

# --- the whole island ------------------------------------------------------------------
tap dev_toggle
await app:dev 5
choose map
tap use
wait 0.3
shot 02-the-row-says-shown with app:dev
tap dev_toggle
await app:none 5
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.4
shot 03-the-whole-island with app:map
press map 0.2
await app:none 5

# --- and back, exactly -----------------------------------------------------------------
tap dev_toggle
await app:dev 5
choose map
tap use
wait 0.3
tap dev_toggle
await app:none 5
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.4
shot 04-as-walked-again with app:map
press map 0.2
await app:none 5
